{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06690","headline":"太学贻张筠 · 储光羲","name":"太学贻张筠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"璧池忝门子，俄顷变炎凉。\n绿竹深虚馆，清流响洞房。\n园林在建业，新友去咸阳。\n中夜鼓钟静，初秋漏刻长。\n浮云开太室，华盖上明堂。\n空此远相望，劳歌还自伤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06690.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06690","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}